# Logging

- **UI components**: use logger helpers from `client/utils/logger.ts` (levels/formatting) — not ad-hoc `console.log`
- **`lib/`**: use the project logger (e.g. `lib/logger.ts`) — not permanent raw `console.log` / `console.error`
- Do not leave debug noise in production paths
